  "body": "## Added\r\n- Vim-like command completion by pressing <kbd>Tab</kbd>\r\n- Support Vim-style numeric count prefixes for keybindings (e.g. `10j` moves\r\n  down 10 rows); the pending count is shown in the status bar\r\n- Add a `proxy` configuration option that routes all of ncspot's network\r\n  traffic (access point, Spotify APIs, OAuth and cover art downloads) through\r\n  a single proxy. Supports HTTP CONNECT proxies and SOCKS5 proxies with\r\n  remote DNS resolution (`socks5h://`), both with optional credentials.\r\n  Without this option, the `http_proxy` environment variable is still\r\n  honoured as before.\r\n- Replace already existing queue notifications instead of stacking new ones.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* chore(deps): bump log from 0.4.33 to 0.4.34 in the cargo group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1865\r\n* chore(toolchain): update by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1864\r\n* chore(toolchain): update by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1869\r\n* chore(deps): bump toml from 1.1.4+spec-1.1.0 to 1.1.5+spec-1.1.0 in the cargo group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1868\r\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group across 1 directory with 5 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1873\r\n* Add a unified proxy configuration option by @VIIII4 in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1876\r\n* chore(deps): bump rand from 0.10.2 to 0.10.3 in the cargo group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1877\r\n* feat: support Vim-style numeric count prefixes for keybindings by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1872\r\n* chore: replace notifications instead of stack by @0xk1f0 in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1870\r\n* feat: vim-style command completion by @koloiyolo in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1863\r\n* chore: Prepare for 1.5.0 release by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1878\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @VIIII4 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1876\r\n* @aw-snap made their first contribution in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1872\r\n* @0xk1f0 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1870\r\n* @koloiyolo made their first contribution in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1863\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/compare/v1.4.0...v1.5.0",
